# Social actions for the three slice villagers (docs/narrative/BIBLE.md). Meh outcomes use the generic lines.

social wren
  loves joke
  likes advice, tease

social hazel
  loves advice
  likes joke
  dislikes tease

social bram
  loves advice
  likes tease
  dislikes compliment

# ---- Wren ----

dialogue social.wren.joke.great
n0 wren: Ha! Oh, that's wonderful. I'm stealing that. Between us, I'll say it's mine.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.wren.joke.good
n0 wren: Ha! Good one. Sit. You've earned a cider.

dialogue social.wren.joke.flop
n0 wren: ...Oh! That was the punchline? Marvelous. Let me improve it for you.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.wren.compliment.great
n0 wren: Careful. I'll be insufferable by closing time.
  expr happy
  emote sparkle

dialogue social.wren.compliment.good
n0 wren: Well. Aren't you sweet. The stool is yours.

dialogue social.wren.compliment.flop
n0 wren: Flattery? Suspicious. What do you want? ...Oh. Nothing. Thank you.
  emote question

dialogue social.wren.advice.great
n0 wren: Advice? Pull up the stool. First: never trust a quiet cider. Second: sit by the fire.
  expr happy

dialogue social.wren.advice.good
n0 wren: My advice? Say yes to the second drink. And no to the third.

dialogue social.wren.advice.flop
n0 wren: Advice? Me? I run a bar. Mostly I improvise. Thank you anyway.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.wren.tease.great
n0 wren: Oh, you wicked thing! I love it. Do it again.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.wren.tease.good
n0 wren: Ha! Cheeky. I like cheeky.

dialogue social.wren.tease.flop
n0 wren: Hm. Funny. I'll remember that when you order.
  emote ellipsis

# ---- Hazel ----

dialogue social.hazel.joke.great
n0 hazel: (She laughs, then covers her mouth.) That was good. I'm writing it down.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.hazel.joke.good
n0 hazel: Ha. Shh... no, it's fine. That was funny.

dialogue social.hazel.joke.flop
n0 hazel: Is that a joke? (She checks the page.) Oh. Oh! Ha. Sorry. Slow reader.
  expr embarrassed
  emote sweat

dialogue social.hazel.compliment.great
n0 hazel: Oh. (She goes pink.) I... thank you. Truly. I'll remember that.
  expr embarrassed
  emote heart

dialogue social.hazel.compliment.good
n0 hazel: That's... kind. Thank you.

dialogue social.hazel.compliment.flop
n0 hazel: Oh. Er. (She hides behind a book.) Thank you. Please stop being nice for a moment.
  expr embarrassed
  emote sweat

dialogue social.hazel.advice.great
n0 hazel: Oh. You want a recommendation? I have a list. (She does.) Start short. Then something sad.
  expr happy
  emote sparkle

dialogue social.hazel.advice.good
n0 hazel: Hm. Let me think. Read slowly. Stay curious.
  expr thinking

dialogue social.hazel.advice.flop
n0 hazel: Advice? I shelve books. (She looks alarmed.) Ask Ione.
  expr surprised
  emote sweat

dialogue social.hazel.tease.great
n0 hazel: (A real smile.) That was fair. And annoying. Well done.
  expr happy
  emote sparkle

dialogue social.hazel.tease.good
n0 hazel: Hm. That was funny. Don't do it again.

dialogue social.hazel.tease.flop
n0 hazel: (She goes very still.) I'm going to alphabetize something now.
  expr embarrassed
  emote ellipsis

# ---- Bram ----

dialogue social.bram.joke.good
n0 bram: Hm. Funny.

dialogue social.bram.joke.great
n0 bram: ...Ha. (A pause.) Hm. Good.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.bram.joke.flop
n0 bram: ...Hm? ...Oh. Joke.
  emote question

dialogue social.bram.compliment.great
n0 bram: ...Hm. Thank you, [player].
  expr embarrassed

dialogue social.bram.compliment.good
n0 bram: Hm. Fine. Keep your tools oiled.

dialogue social.bram.compliment.flop
n0 bram: ...Hm. (He scowls at the anvil.) No need for that.
  expr embarrassed
  emote sweat

dialogue social.bram.advice.great
n0 bram: Advice. Hm. Heat it slowly. Strike once, strike true. Then leave it alone.
  expr happy

dialogue social.bram.advice.good
n0 bram: Hm. Oil your tools. That's the whole secret.

dialogue social.bram.advice.flop
n0 bram: ...Advice. Ask Juno. She talks.
  emote ellipsis

dialogue social.bram.tease.great
n0 bram: ...Hm. (His mouth twitches.) Cheeky. Hm.
  expr happy
  emote sparkle

dialogue social.bram.tease.good
n0 bram: Hm. Cheeky.

dialogue social.bram.tease.flop
n0 bram: (He looks at you. Then at the anvil. Then at you.) Hm. Busy.
  emote ellipsis
